msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/certificationLevelFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "certificationLevel is functional"
msgstr "certificationLevel 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/certificationLevelFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:certificationLevel is functional: a gmeow:Certification records exactly one care level for the single binding it attests, since one attestation cannot be simultaneously casual and positive."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:certificationLevel 是函数式的：一个 gmeow:Certification 为其证明的唯一绑定记录恰好一个谨慎程度，因为一次证明不能同时既是随意的又是确证的。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/certifiedIdentityFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "certifiedIdentity is functional"
msgstr "certifiedIdentity 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/certifiedIdentityFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:certifiedIdentity is functional: a gmeow:Certification binds its key to exactly one gmeow:Agent identity, since a claim binding the key to a different identity is a separate certification across standpoints rather than a second identity on this one."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:certifiedIdentity 是函数式的：一个 gmeow:Certification 将其密钥绑定到恰好一个 gmeow:Agent 身份，因为将该密钥绑定到不同身份的主张属于跨立场的另一份证明，而非此证明上的第二个身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/certifiedKeyFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "certifiedKey is functional"
msgstr "certifiedKey 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/certifiedKeyFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:certifiedKey is functional: a gmeow:Certification vouches for exactly one gmeow:CryptographicKey, since the key half of the attested binding is singular and a different key is a different attestation. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:certifiedKey 是函数式的：一个 gmeow:Certification 恰好为一个 gmeow:CryptographicKey 作担保，因为所证明绑定中「密钥」的那一半是单一的，不同的密钥意味着不同的证明。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/certifierFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "certifier is functional"
msgstr "certifier 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/certifierFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:certifier is functional: a gmeow:Certification is made by exactly one certifying gmeow:Agent, since a second signer's attestation of the same binding is a separate certification rather than a second certifier on this one."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:certifier 是函数式的：一个 gmeow:Certification 恰好由一个进行认证的 gmeow:Agent 作出，因为第二位签署者对同一绑定的证明构成另一份证明，而非此证明上的第二个认证者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/introducerAmountFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "introducerAmount is functional"
msgstr "introducerAmount 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/introducerAmountFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:introducerAmount is functional: a gmeow:TrustAssertion carries exactly one introducer amount, since one trustor assigns one trust-signature weight to its trustee and a different weight is a different assertion. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:introducerAmount 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:TrustAssertion 恰好携带一个介绍人权重,因为一个信任方对其受信方赋予一个信任签名权重,不同的权重即是不同的断言。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/introducerDepthFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "introducerDepth is functional"
msgstr "introducerDepth 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/introducerDepthFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:introducerDepth is functional: a gmeow:TrustAssertion declares exactly one introducer depth, since a single assertion fixes one bound on how many indirect introducer levels the trustor will follow rather than several competing bounds."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:introducerDepth 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:TrustAssertion 恰好声明一个介绍人深度,因为单一断言只固定一个界限,规定信任方将追随多少级间接介绍人,而不是设定若干相互竞争的界限。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/keySchemeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "keyScheme is functional"
msgstr "keyScheme 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/keySchemeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:keyScheme is functional: a gmeow:CryptographicKey has exactly one scheme — OpenPGP, X.509, SSH, or Nostr — since a key of a different format is a different key. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:keyScheme 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:CryptographicKey 恰好具有一种方案——OpenPGP、X.509、SSH 或 Nostr——因为格式不同的密钥即是不同的密钥。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/signatureAlgorithmFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "signatureAlgorithm is functional"
msgstr "signatureAlgorithm 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/signatureAlgorithmFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:signatureAlgorithm is functional: a gmeow:CryptographicSignature was produced with exactly one algorithm, since one signing act uses one algorithm and a signature made with a different algorithm is a different signature. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:signatureAlgorithm 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:CryptographicSignature 恰好是用一种算法生成的,因为一次签名行为只使用一种算法,用不同算法生成的签名是另一份不同的签名。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/signingDomainFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "signingDomain is functional"
msgstr "signingDomain 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/signingDomainFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:signingDomain is functional: a gmeow:CryptographicSignature asserts exactly one signing domain, since a single signature carries one claimed signing authority such as one DKIM d= tag. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:signingDomain 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:CryptographicSignature 恰好声明一个签名域,因为单一签名只承载一个所声称的签名机构,例如一个 DKIM d= 标签。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/signingKeyFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "signingKey is functional"
msgstr "signingKey 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/signingKeyFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:signingKey is functional: a gmeow:CryptographicSignature is produced by exactly one gmeow:CryptographicKey, since one signing act uses the one specific key whose binding to the signer a certification vouches for. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:signingKey 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:CryptographicSignature 恰好由一个 gmeow:CryptographicKey 生成,因为一次签名行为使用的是那唯一一把特定密钥,其与签名者之间的绑定由某项认证担保。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/trustLevelFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "trustLevel is functional"
msgstr "trustLevel 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/trustLevelFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:trustLevel is functional: a gmeow:TrustAssertion expresses exactly one owner-trust degree — ultimate, full, marginal, or none — being one trustor's subjective level toward its trustee and never two degrees on the same assertion."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:trustLevel 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:TrustAssertion 恰好表达一个所有者信任程度——终极、完全、有限或无——是一个信任方对其受信方的主观程度,同一断言上绝不会出现两个程度。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/trusteeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "trustee is functional"
msgstr "trustee 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/trusteeFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:trustee is functional: a gmeow:TrustAssertion names exactly one trustee, since a single assertion expresses one trustor's stance toward one trusted agent and trust in another agent is a separate assertion. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:trustee 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:TrustAssertion 恰好指定一个受信方,因为单一断言只表达一个信任方对一个受信代理的立场,对另一代理的信任则是另一独立断言。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/trustorFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "trustor is functional"
msgstr "trustor 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/trustorFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:trustor is functional: a gmeow:TrustAssertion is held from exactly one trustor's standpoint, being the single perspective holder whose subjective trust it expresses, since another agent's trust is a separate assertion (Principle 9). This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:trustor 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:TrustAssertion 恰好持自一个信任方的立场,是其所表达主观信任的唯一视角持有者,因为另一代理的信任是另一独立断言(原则 9)。该记录不是该术语的定义，也绝不是形状：义务由该记录推理得出，而非在别处重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verificationStatusFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "verificationStatus is functional"
msgstr "verificationStatus 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/verificationStatusFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:verificationStatus is functional: a gmeow:CryptographicSignature carries exactly one verification outcome from a given verifier, since a competing verifier's differing result is recorded as a separate signature observation rather than a second status here."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:verificationStatus 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:CryptographicSignature 恰好携带来自某一验证者的一个验证结果,因为竞争验证者给出的不同结果应记录为一次独立的签名观察,而不是在此处增加第二个状态。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/certificationLevelFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:certificationLevel names exactly one value; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."
msgstr "当原生一致性门必须强制 gmeow:certificationLevel 恰好命名一个值 时使用；该记录是门所连接的规范载体，因此该义务是被推理出来的，而非在形状表面上重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/certificationLevelFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid this record when a second value would make the record ambiguous — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."
msgstr "当第二个值会使该记录产生歧义时避免使用该记录——应撤回该断言而非削弱它，且绝不将其复刻为手写形状。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/certificationLevelFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Read together with logic:characteristicSort: the pair (logic:characterizes gmeow:certificationLevel, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) is the whole obligation, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching characteristic from it."
msgstr "与 logic:characteristicSort 一并阅读：(logic:characterizes gmeow:certificationLevel, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) 这一对构成完整义务，OWL 基础视图据此投影出相应特征。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/certificationLevelFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:certificationLevelFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:certificationLevel ."
msgstr "gmeow:certificationLevelFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:certificationLevel ."

